{"id":"n17238-1-11","stage":1,"title":"콜라 · 可乐","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17238-1-11-1","ko":"엄마, 냉장고에 콜라가 없어요. 콜라 사 주세요.","zh":"妈妈，冰箱里没有可乐了。请帮我买点可乐吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"냉장고에","meaning":"冰箱","explanation":"냉장고：冰箱；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"냉장고","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31524","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉장고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉장고에","audio":"/audio/5908e5f7eb6dd820ecf9.mp3"}},{"text":"콜라가","meaning":"可乐","explanation":"콜라：可乐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"콜라","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17238","senseId":"1","lemma":"콜라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콜라가","audio":"/audio/9662bb31b81b6f2eb13c.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不在","explanation":"없다：不在；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}},{"text":"콜라","meaning":"可乐","explanation":"콜라：可乐","readings":[{"term":"콜라","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17238","senseId":"1","lemma":"콜라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콜라","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3"}},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사","audio":"/audio/98ebd37ce3c1cd6abbe7.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"b3bf31f65841d3e1","term":"냉장고","zh":"冰箱","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3","entryId":"31524","definition":"为避免食物坏掉或为了冷却而在低温中进行保管的箱式机器。","pronunciation":["냉ː장고"]},{"id":"38c60dc0fd3443a8","term":"콜라","zh":"可乐","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3","entryId":"17238","definition":"味甜且具有独特的香味的黑色碳酸饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人、事物、现象等不占据某处或空间。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c4c6112f6a3b8f91e9b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17238-1-11-2","ko":"그냥 물 마시렴. 콜라 너무 많이 마시면 건강에 안 좋아.","zh":"喝点水就好。可乐喝太多对健康不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"물","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}},{"text":"마시렴.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시렴","audio":"/audio/77bd10055b90bccc9bd8.mp3"}},{"text":"콜라","meaning":"可乐","explanation":"콜라：可乐","readings":[{"term":"콜라","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17238","senseId":"1","lemma":"콜라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콜라","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"마시면","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시면","audio":"/audio/0ebf111f176ad5de0c21.mp3"}},{"text":"건강에","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-